      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `2c879da1c929828bec3237bb03aa362d9ca3e8f3af4347433fa33a1a199fb9f7--prisoners-australia-2016-cube-1-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Prisoners in Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2016\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 14 of 14\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | bd36b04439948e724a60bdeb407ef2a5627e3703d6ce109ca3bfa12db2e5c199 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 53bf603f2d394630aec04b46a81cf55c84f568a4facb87fe30c44a5244e370fb | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | e3e7c2655e01cf1cd956acfbafc7940b952400ac4457676823bba7c3ab4d6d3f | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 99e3f158a6d06e002fdf6e92e56a49f8daea6468fe3435e5f6ee474651e72094 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | bf164d90bb1656f5b4748425e2540392a9269973d414a0cbd4fee7fcdaf85b7a | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 44b3765797833e596e3ea9596e4e5619a5c7363bf3ae12154aaaaf02cecc0508 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 77a8589cc4c76e16131c43f948673c7d826999d83698c66a5881755afdad7c8e | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | e47041bc1d18bb51e5ea114aef3d5aaf558ec4ca46c717c030e89c130645da16 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 3289ad5eabfe9fc1f7aed86ff57a7f571b13b70dcde0b84877d35e82724e126d | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 92c56f61989486e485a544dba0614e5bef9f813af1b39f4ca24ac53e85b0e3d7 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 117a1e17f720abc38fa1662195bf130b890a47c7fa7f03f9219e531ebedd5e1d | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | f766d616abad03f7625dbf10bc7953a184a4f51a0bf6fce05a7dea26e2409c24 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | 38d7d5ed0e0d5055c03157ec368e58f3b8d22302ad9a61f9b9a6e7bb57052d6d | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 5e21b961e99c04a8fe094f4e9b2d988c95bac62e83a9564995d671dc4da714a4 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
